OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear and cloudy periods overnight
OL,7,Fwith light rain or showers possible.
OL,8,FMist or fog patches forming by dawn in
OL,9,Flight winds. A slightly fresher night
OL,10,Fthan last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry with warm sunny spells
OL,13,Ffor most, although isolated light
OL,14,Fshowers may develop during the middle
OL,15,Fof the day. Winds picking up in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, before easing by the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
