OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry
OL,6,FFriday morning, wet and windy for some
OL,7,Flater. Cloudy and possibly wet in
OL,8,Fplaces Saturday. Fog patches Sunday
OL,9,Fmorning, dry with variable amounts of
OL,10,Fcloud later. Above average
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
